Subject: [PATCH 3/3] pkgs/sagemath-*/setup.py: Add flint to required_modules

---
 pkgs/sagemath-eclib/setup.py                 | 1 +
 pkgs/sagemath-flint/setup.py                 | 2 +-
 pkgs/sagemath-groups/setup.py                | 1 +
 pkgs/sagemath-iml/setup.py                   | 2 +-
 pkgs/sagemath-linbox/setup.py                | 2 +-
 pkgs/sagemath-macaulay2/setup.py             | 1 +
 pkgs/sagemath-msolve/setup.py                | 1 +
 pkgs/sagemath-pari/setup.py                  | 2 +-
 pkgs/sagemath-schemes/setup.py               | 1 +
 pkgs/sagemath-singular/setup.py              | 2 +-
 pkgs/sagemath-standard-no-symbolics/setup.py | 1 +
